# Template for .env.local — the tracked .env holds the non-secret defaults that
# apply everywhere, and everything here exists to override them on one machine:
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Uncomment only what this machine needs.

## Overrides

# PUBLIC_WS_URL=wss://example.invalid/ws
# PUBLIC_DEBUG=false

## Secrets

# There are none yet. When one appears, it gets a commented placeholder here,
# its real value in .env.local, and is read via $env/dynamic/private — never
# under a PUBLIC_ name, which ships the value to the browser.